  <jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row20Member">㈱IDCフロンティア</jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries>
  <jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row21Member">テレニシ㈱</jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries>
  <jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row22Member">LINEヤフーコミュニケーションズ㈱</jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries>
  <jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row23Member">㈱一休</jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries>
  <jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row24Member">PayPayカード㈱</jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries>
  <jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row25Member">ASKUL　LOGIST㈱</jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries>
  <jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row26Member">㈱チャーム</jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries>
